Table full name: HTAN_2.HTAN.OTHER_ASSAY_METADATA_CURRENT
Column name: File_Format Type: TEXT Description: Format of a file (e.g. txt, csv, fastq, bam, etc.)
Column name: Id Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier of entity e.g. a96059eb-81af-4b24-ae50-9242c0d8f819
Column name: Filename Type: TEXT Description: Name of a file
Column name: HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID Type: TEXT Description: HTAN Biospecimen Identifier (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz) indicating the biospecimen(s) from which these files were derived; multiple parent biospecimen should be comma-separated
Column name: entityId Type: TEXT Description: Synapse ID of entity
Column name: Component Type: TEXT Description: Category of metadata (e.g. Diagnosis, Biospecimen, scRNA-seq Level 1, etc.); provide the same one for all items/rows.
Sample rows:
[{'HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID': 'HTA1_313_932301', 'Filename': 'data_integration_MBC/HTAPP-313-SMP-932_HE_1_processed.jpg', 'entityId': 'syn26077448', 'Component': 'OtherAssay', 'File_Format': 'jpg'}, {'HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID': 'HTA1_213_6752301', 'Filename': 'data_integration_MBC/HTAPP-213-SMP-6752_HE_1_processed.jpg', 'entityId': 'syn26077453', 'Component': 'OtherAssay', 'File_Format': 'jpg'}, {'HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID': 'HTA1_330_1082301', 'Filename': 'data_integration_MBC/HTAPP-330-SMP-1082_HE_1_processed.jpg', 'entityId': 'syn26077447', 'Component': 'OtherAssay', 'File_Format': 'jpg'}, {'HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID': 'HTA1_364_1321306', 'Filename': 'data_integration_MBC/HTAPP-364-SMP-1321_HE_2_processed.jpg', 'entityId': 'syn26077450', 'Component': 'OtherAssay', 'File_Format': 'jpg'}, {'HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID': 'HTA1_514_6760306', 'Filename': 'data_integration_MBC/HTAPP-514-SMP-6760_HE_2_processed.jpg', 'entityId': 'syn26077462', 'Component': 'OtherAssay', 'File_Format': 'jpg'}]

